{"term": {"label": "道", "occurrences": 12, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "周", "id": "周"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "覺", "id": "覺"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.3470368555648795, "source": "見", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.817040484810615, "source": "見", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 1.4307461236907244, "source": "見", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 0.8429594587886053, "source": "見", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.6538896750049343, "source": "見", "target": "門"}, {"weight": 2.2192034840549946, "source": "賢", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 0.49643688631389105, "source": "賢", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.9382696385929302, "source": "賢", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.749199854809259, "source": "賢", "target": "門"}, {"weight": 1.774517662793549, "source": "君子", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.7300291078209855, "source": "君子", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 3.240854731586976, "source": "君子", "target": "養"}, {"weight": 2.1422424429188665, "source": "君子", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.0813704822336037, "source": "養", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.03688192726104, "source": "養", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 1.449095262358921, "source": "養", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.4127276181880462, "source": "門", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.486835590341768, "source": "門", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.1058747987479913, "source": "門", "target":